{
  "name": "dsh-ecom-video-seedance",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "带货视频拆解工作台（零 API 密钥 · agent 原生）：analyze.py 抽帧切镜给出关键帧清单，agent 用视觉能力读帧写分镜表与提示词包，replicate.py 硬校验（每镜≤200字/完整版≤800字）并渲染 md+HTML；seedance_storyboard 分镜表持久化（save/list/get/delete/history/stats/restore，每保存一次多一版）。侧栏「带货视频拆解」工作台：概览 / 我的分镜 / 生成历史 / 拆解·创作 / S-A-C-S-C 规范。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/host.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/host.js",
    "./client": "./dist/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "files": [
    "src",
    "dist",
    "lib",
    "lab",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2 <0.3.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.10"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node test/lib.test.mjs",
    "selftest": "node scripts/selftest.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build"
  }
}
